269
00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.840
Come on!

270
00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.039
You can do better than cliches
like that.

271
00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.559
A storm is destructive.

272
00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:30.159
Is that maybe how you feel
about yourself?

273
00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.640
I didn't kill my mum.

274
00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:33.919
Remember?

275
00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.919
In your version of events.
who did?

276
00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.799
That's what YOU have to work out.

277
00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:42.159
No. No. that's the role
of the police and the legal team.

278
00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.559
My role is to help you make sense
