279
00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:47.199
Mm. you're here to find the truth.

280
00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.239
And how would I do that?

281
00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:53.680
Get me outside. Wheels.
and we'll see.

282
00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.279
