for our next session.

285
00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.159
She seems to want to draw.

286
00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.639
It could help bypass
any verbal defences.

287
00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:16.199
Oh. come on. I'm not going to let
her loose with the Stanley knife.

288
00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:18.640
OK. Don't make me regret it.

289
00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.439
Oh. you fancy an Oxsmith
outing tonight?

290
00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.639
Some big energy company
is building a wind farm.

291
00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:28.479
They're trying to get
the local community on side.

292
00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.079
All the big employees in the area
have been invited.

293
00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:33.399
Ah. no. it's not really my thing.

294
00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:35.719
Schmoozing the locals with booze?

295
00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:37.119
Free booze?

296
00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:37.872
- Gail?
- Yeah?

297
00:21:37.873 --> 00:21:40.599
- Can we make sure that.
uh. Dr Fox's name is on the list

298
00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:42.560
- for the Trenmoor do?
- Yeah. of course.

