314
00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:39.199
It might be different from before.
but that's OK.

315
00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:41.439
There's no right
or wrong way to orgasm.

316
00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:45.199
There's only your way.
Don't put pressure on yourself.

