321
00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:03.559
Thanks. Thanks.

322
00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:12.439
Could you move. please? Thank you.

323
00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:13.799
Some of these protesters have got

324
00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:15.919
completely the wrong end
of the stick.

325
00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:18.399
cos we're actually proposing
