328
00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:27.359
I'm going to hand you over now
to your local MP.

329
00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.840
the formidable Caroline Wren.

330
00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.279
Diolch yn fawr iawn. Max.

331
00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:36.639
Well. it'll be no surprise
to most of you

332
00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:40.399
that I support Trenmoor Energy's
planning application.

333
00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:42.599
I grew up in Porth Hen.

334
00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:47.479
My dad and his dad worked
in the local steel plant.

335
00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:50.799
